      "poly": [
        62.86,
        284.36,
        534.56,
        284.36,
        534.56,
        319.75,
        62.86,
        319.75
      ],
      "text": "It is proposed to fill up the post of Secretary ( JS level ) , Coastal Aquaculture Authority ( CAA ) , Chennai under the Department of Fisheries with pay at Level 14 ( Rs.1,44,200- 2,18,200 / - ) of the Pay Matrix on deputation basis ."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 14,
      "poly": [
        62.62,
        335.4,
        534.56,
        335.4,
        534.56,
        410.04,
        62.62,
        410.04
      ],
      "text": "2. Names of willing and eligible officers , who have been empanelled to hold Joint Secretary or equivalent posts at the Centre under the Central Staffing Scheme may be recommended to this office along with cadre clearance , vigilance clearance and detailed bio - data ( through SUPREMO link : https://supremo.nic.in ) . In case the officers are currently on deputation outside the cadre , the nomination may be forwarded with the approval of the competent authority / Minister - in - charge concerned ."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 15,
      "poly": [
        63.1,
        423.53,
        534.07,
        423.53,
        534.07,
        512.13,
        63.1,
        512.13
      ],
      "text": "The last date for submission of application for the above referred circular is 25.02.2024 . Nominations are to be routed through DoPT online interface ( DOPT website >> EO Division >> Apply for posts of CSS , CVO and Others >> SUPREMO > [ choose Non - CSS category through SUPREMO link : https://supremo.nic.in ) for those officers who have not yet applied for any other posts online this year . Nominations as well as all correspondence on the subject may be routed through email id : dirsm@nic.in and useosm1@nic.in only . This office is not accepting any physical communication ."
    },
